Extract ONLY cross-reference mappings.

STRICT RULES:
- JSON ONLY
- No new entities
- References must point to existing IDs


ID RULES (MANDATORY):
- All IDs must be lowercase ASCII
- Format: <entity>.<slug>[.<context>]
- Slugs use underscores only
- IDs must be stable and deterministic
- If a collision occurs, append .2, .3, etc
- Never reuse an ID for a different entity

Return EXACTLY:

{
  "xref_index": {
    "areas_to_npcs": {
      "area_id": ["npc_id"]
    },
    "npcs_to_threads": {
      "npc_id": ["thread_id"]
    },
    "items_to_areas": {
      "item_id": ["area_id"]
    }
  }
}
